  "segments": [
    {
      "start_ms": 310,
      "end_ms": 1330,
      "text": "没有妈妈的庇护，",
      "token_start": 0,
      "token_end_exclusive": 7
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 1470,
      "end_ms": 3250,
      "text": "其实爸爸并没有那么爱孩子，",
      "token_start": 7,
      "token_end_exclusive": 19
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 3850,
      "end_ms": 6790,
      "text": "这是我今天在网上看到点赞很高的一句话。",
      "token_start": 19,
      "token_end_exclusive": 37
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 7070,
      "end_ms": 10610,
      "text": "因为亲生的和亲自生的肯定不一样，",
      "token_start": 37,
      "token_end_exclusive": 52
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 10870,
      "end_ms": 12050,
      "text": "不知道你赞同吗？",
      "token_start": 52,
      "token_end_exclusive": 59
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 12770,
      "end_ms": 14030,
      "text": "只过最贵的房子，",
      "token_start": 59,
      "token_end_exclusive": 66
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 14450,
      "end_ms": 15510,
      "text": "是妈妈的身体，",
      "token_start": 66,
      "token_end_exclusive": 72
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 15990,
      "end_ms": 18690,
      "text": "喝过最贵的水是妈妈的乳汁。",
      "token_start": 72,
      "token_end_exclusive": 84
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 19310,
      "end_ms": 22710,
      "text": "因为过最温暖的港湾是妈妈的怀抱。",
      "token_start": 84,
      "token_end_exclusive": 99
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 23370,
      "end_ms": 25850,
      "text": "其实啊也并不是说爸爸天生绝情，",
      "token_start": 99,
      "token_end_exclusive": 113
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 25850,
      "end_ms": 26650,
      "text": "不爱孩子，",
      "token_start": 113,
      "token_end_exclusive": 117
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 27210,
      "end_ms": 28030,
      "text": "只是他的爱，",
      "token_start": 117,
      "token_end_exclusive": 122
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 28230,
      "end_ms": 32120,
      "text": "更多的需要妈妈在中间搭建桥才能够落到实处。",
      "token_start": 122,
      "token_end_exclusive": 142
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 32840,
      "end_ms": 38060,
      "text": "其实啊这个世界上很多东西都是妈妈为孩子争取来的，",
      "token_start": 142,
      "token_end_exclusive": 165
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 38720,
      "end_ms": 40845,
      "text": "不知道你信不信。",
      "token_start": 165,
      "token_end_exclusive": 172
    }
